{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"function uiMessageToModelMessages(uiMessage): ModelMessage<\n  | string\n  | ContentPart<unknown, unknown, unknown, unknown, unknown>[]\n  | null>[];","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/messages.ts#L591","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/activities/chat/messages.ts:591"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Convert a UIMessage to ModelMessage(s)"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Walks the parts array IN ORDER to preserve the interleaving of text,\ntool calls, and tool results. This is critical for multi-round tool\nflows where the model generates text, calls a tool, gets the result,\nthen generates more text and calls another tool."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The output preserves the sequential structure:\ntext1 → toolCall1 → toolResult1 → text2 → toolCall2 → toolResult2\nbecomes:\nassistant: {content: \"text1\", toolCalls: [toolCall1]}\ntool: toolResult1\nassistant: {content: \"text2\", toolCalls: [toolCall2]}\ntool: toolResult2"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"uimessage","children":[{"type":"text","value":"uiMessage"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/UIMessage.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"UIMessage"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The UIMessage to convert"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/ModelMessage.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ModelMessage"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<\n| "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"string"},{"type":"text","value":"\n| "},{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/ContentPart.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ContentPart"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"},{"type":"text","value":">[]\n| "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"null"},{"type":"text","value":">[]"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"An array of ModelMessages preserving part ordering"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"uimessage","text":"uiMessage","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction uiMessageToModelMessages(uiMessage): ModelMessage<\n  | string\n  | ContentPart<unknown, unknown, unknown, unknown, unknown>[]\n  | null>[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/messages.ts:591](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/messages.ts#L591)\n\nConvert a UIMessage to ModelMessage(s)\n\nWalks the parts array IN ORDER to preserve the interleaving of text,\ntool calls, and tool results. This is critical for multi-round tool\nflows where the model generates text, calls a tool, gets the result,\nthen generates more text and calls another tool.\n\nThe output preserves the sequential structure:\n  text1 → toolCall1 → toolResult1 → text2 → toolCall2 → toolResult2\nbecomes:\n  assistant: {content: \"text1\", toolCalls: [toolCall1]}\n  tool: toolResult1\n  assistant: {content: \"text2\", toolCalls: [toolCall2]}\n  tool: toolResult2\n\n## Parameters\n\n### uiMessage\n\n[`UIMessage`](../interfaces/UIMessage.md)\n\nThe UIMessage to convert\n\n## Returns\n\n[`ModelMessage`](../interfaces/ModelMessage.md)\\<\n  \\| `string`\n  \\| [`ContentPart`](../type-aliases/ContentPart.md)\\<`unknown`, `unknown`, `unknown`, `unknown`, `unknown`\\>[]\n  \\| `null`\\>[]\n\nAn array of ModelMessages preserving part ordering\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: uiMessageToModelMessages\ntitle: uiMessageToModelMessages\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction uiMessageToModelMessages(uiMessage): ModelMessage<\n  | string\n  | ContentPart<unknown, unknown, unknown, unknown, unknown>[]\n  | null>[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/messages.ts:591](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/messages.ts#L591)\n\nConvert a UIMessage to ModelMessage(s)\n\nWalks the parts array IN ORDER to preserve the interleaving of text,\ntool calls, and tool results. This is critical for multi-round tool\nflows where the model generates text, calls a tool, gets the result,\nthen generates more text and calls another tool.\n\nThe output preserves the sequential structure:\n  text1 → toolCall1 → toolResult1 → text2 → toolCall2 → toolResult2\nbecomes:\n  assistant: {content: \"text1\", toolCalls: [toolCall1]}\n  tool: toolResult1\n  assistant: {content: \"text2\", toolCalls: [toolCall2]}\n  tool: toolResult2\n\n## Parameters\n\n### uiMessage\n\n[`UIMessage`](../interfaces/UIMessage.md)\n\nThe UIMessage to convert\n\n## Returns\n\n[`ModelMessage`](../interfaces/ModelMessage.md)\\<\n  \\| `string`\n  \\| [`ContentPart`](../type-aliases/ContentPart.md)\\<`unknown`, `unknown`, `unknown`, `unknown`, `unknown`\\>[]\n  \\| `null`\\>[]\n\nAn array of ModelMessages preserving part ordering\n"}
